                        <div class="mp-erd mp-erd-mini mp-erd-row">
                            <div>
                                <p class="mp-eyebrow">Rules that can’t be broken</p>
                                <h4>The database refuses bad data before the app ever sees it.</h4>
                                <p>Instead of trusting every screen to check the math, the table itself does: a fare has to equal the price minus the discount, and a trip has to end after it starts. Anything that breaks a rule never gets saved.</p>
